        <td>🧠 <strong>Programmers</strong></td>
        <td>Code the logic, data pipelines, visualizers, and AI</td>
        <td>Create an interface that maps enzyme function to harmonic profiles</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>🔬 <strong>Quantum Chemists</strong></td>
        <td>Provide models of tunneling, bonding, and coherent electron flows</td>
        <td>Simulate how cryopreserved enzyme pathways can be restored with precise light pulses</td>
